advisable, as after } 14. Bxf4 { Black must deal with d6, they manage to keep the pawn with } { [%csl Rd6] } 14... Ne5 { But after } 15. gxh6 Bxh6 16. Bxh6 Rxh6 17. O-O-O $16 { White has a safer king and a big advantage. } { [%csl Gc1,Re8] }) 14. Bh3 exf4 { Black has to seek some
