have moves. } 14... Rf8 15. Nd2! { correct plan: Nc4 next. } { [%cal Gd2c4,Gc4d6] } 15... Be7 16. Nc4 Bb4 17. Nd5 $16 { White had a big advantage in
Pranesh-Iniyan, 2025. } *


