highlight the drawback with: } 8. Bg5! { Good reply, and Black doesn't have Nbd7. } { [%csl Yc6,Rf6][%cal Gg5f6,Gc3d5] } 8... Qb6 { Best. } (8... e6 { leads to a good version of the 7...e5 line after: } 9. fxe6 fxe6 10. Nxc6 Qxc6 11. Be2 $14 { Bh5+ is an annoying threat to deal
