promising. } { [%cal Gg2g4] }) 13. Qe1!? { Typical antidote. } { [%csl Re8][%cal Ge1e8] } 13... Bb4 14. Qg3 Nh5! { Weird engine line: } 15. Qf3 Qa5 16. Rd3 Bxc3! { Black must enter the complications: } 17. Rxc3 dxe4 18. Qd1! { Funny defense. } { [%csl Rd8][%cal Gd1d8,Ra5c3] } 18... h6 19. Bh4 O-O 20. Kb2 Nf4 21. Bc4 Nd5 22. Bxd5 exd5 23. f6! { White achieves to damage the structure. } { [%csl Bf6] } 23... g6 24. Bg3 Rb5 25. Qd4! $14 { To stop
