objectively White has a very large advantage. } { [%csl Ba3] }) 10. a3 $16 { to stop b4, and White has a comfortable advantage. } { [%cal Rb5b4,Rd7c5,Gd1e2] } 10... d5?! { tried in the only game that reached the position, but it's a desperate attempt. } 11. exd5 Qe5+ 12. Nde2 { The d5-pawn is
