simply carry on with development. } { [%cal Gc1e3,Ge1c1] } 12... f6 { Fedoseev-Iljiushenko, 2020. Fedoseev took now, but even stronger was } 13. g6 $146 { [%csl Bg6] } 13... Nxg6 14. h5 Nf4 15. Be3 $18 { And f6 severely weakened the light squares, so Black is just lost already. We
